  "display_title": "Lessons for Your Pet Human",
  "description": "Pet humans are kept for the amusement of the gods. While other gods treat their pet humans as mere toys, Ouranos takes a more loving and compassisonate approach to rearing his “companion human,” as he calls them. But when Ouranos is called out of town for a long period of time, he has no choice but to leave his pet human in the care of Erebos, the god of darkness. Erebos finds the human’s spoiled attitude dispicable and decides to teach him a few lessons… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
